You have submitted a work order in regard to the HVAC system not functioning properly. We are dispatching a vendor to the property to assess and fix any problem. 
<br/><br/>
Please be sure that you have:
<br/>
<ul>
<li>Changed the filter within the last 30 days;</li>
<li>Checked the breakers to ensure they haven't tripped into the OFF position;</li>
<li>Checked the thermostat batteries; and</li>
<li>Verified that the pilot light is lit and that the furnace/air handler is plugged in.</li>
</ul>
If the vendor comes and the problem is related to any of the listed items, a service charge will be applied to your account. 
 <br/><br/>
Please be expecting a call from the vendor. You likely will not recognize their phone number, so make sure you answer any unknown calls please.
